it","summary":"ABDM posts the care contexts a patient chose to link; the HIP issues a link reference number and sends an OTP.","title":"A request to start linking a care context","type":"callback"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-abdm-user-initiated-linking-hip/03-m2-post-user-initiated-linking-v3-link-care-context-on-confirm#m2-on-link-confirm","id":"hiecm.endpoint.m2-on-link-confirm","summary":"The HIP checks the patient's code and answers a link confirm request with the care contexts it linked.","title":"Link On-Confirm, HIP confirms linked care contexts","type":"endpoint"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-callbacks/07-m2-post-v3-hip-link-care-context-confirm#m2-on-link-confirm","id":"hiecm.callback.m2-on-link-confirm","summary":"ABDM posts the code the patient entered and the link reference number; the HIP checks them and answers on-confirm.","title":"Confirmation of a link, carrying the token the patient approved","type":"callback"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-callbacks/05-m2-post-v3-hip-patient-care-context-discover#m2-on-discovery-request","id":"hiecm.callback.m2-on-discovery-request","summary":"ABDM asks the HIP to find a patient's unlinked care contexts from their name, gender, year of birth and identifiers.","title":"A discovery request for a patient you may hold records for","type":"callback"},{"doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m2/endpoints/m2-callbacks/09-m2-post-v3-hip-health-information-request#m2-on-health-information-request","id":"hiecm.callback.m2-on-health-information-request","summary":"ABDM posts an HIU's data request to the HIP, with the consent artefact id, date range, push URL and key material.","title":"A request for the records a consent covers","type":"callback"}]}
